WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.702
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.736
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.171
And now we're going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:08.741
The White House is reportedly
lobbying news organizations

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:11.377
to give President Biden
more favorable press coverage,

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:12.945
or as CNN reported it,

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:17.149 line:0%
"Desperate Biden
begs for compliments."

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:18.618
Ahead of President Biden's

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:21.387
first-ever summit of global
democracies this week,

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:24.457
Chinese officials questioned
how a country like the U.S.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:25.825
could lecture other nations

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.760
given its polarized
domestic politics

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.729
and botched
coronavirus response.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:32.698
Man, it sucks when someone you
don't like makes a good point.

00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:36.236
It's like O.J. telling kids
to get vaccinated.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:41.508
He's not wrong, you just don't
love agreeing with him.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:44.344
"Listen to 'Juice,' kids,
but not that part."

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:49.015
During his trip today
to Kansas City, Missouri,

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.816
President Biden
unveiled new branding

00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:52.652
for his Build Back Better plan.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:55.154
Cool, maybe you can
change the name

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:57.557
so it doesn't sound like
a chiropractor's office

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.159
in a strip mall.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.496
During a recent
panel discussion,

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.365
West Virginia senator
Joe Manchin

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.367
referred to Democrats using
the third-person "they."

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:12.638
Even worse, he referred
to coal lobbyists as "we."

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:15.107
That's right,
Democratic senator Joe Manchin

00:01:15.107 --> 00:01:17.577
referred to Democrats
using the third-person "they."

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:20.079
Not cool, but I do
the same thing with my family

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:21.281
when I'm home for the holidays.

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.917
They want to go
to Applebee's again.

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:27.119
A boater in Florida
recently discovered

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:28.554
a package in the ocean

00:01:28.554 --> 00:01:31.391
that was filled with
$1 million worth of cocaine.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:35.061
Damn, no wonder he's always
in such a good mood.

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:36.295
I mean, come on.

00:01:36.295 --> 00:01:39.265
You don't have the idea
to live in a pineapple

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:42.501
without doing some coke first.

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:44.837
Tampa Bay Buccaneers quarterback
Tom Brady

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:47.707
announced plans this week
for a new collection of NFTs

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.842
that will include a stopwatch,
cleats,

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:51.977
the jersey he wore
at the NFL combine,

00:01:51.977 --> 00:01:53.646
and even his very first helmet.

00:01:55.881 --> 00:01:59.152
And finally, the makers of Oreos
have announced a partnership

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:00.854
with the wine brand Barefoot

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:03.222
to offer an Oreo Thins
red-blend wine

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:06.625
which complements the chocolate
and cream of the cookies.

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:10.396
So if you're craving Oreos
and red wine, don't worry.

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:13.900
You're gonna get through
this breakup.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.735
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

